    "id": "pose_09_hands_on_hips",
    "name": "Standing, hands on hips",
    "description": "Standing upright and square to the viewer with the feet planted wider than the hips, toes turned slightly out and both knees straight. Both hands rest on the sides of the waist just above the hips, fingers pointing forward and down, with the elbows bent and flared out to the sides and slightly back. Head level, facing forward. Left/right are the character's own.",
    "targetModels": [
      "female",
      "male"
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Reference: user-supplied image (ai-pose-gallery.pages.dev full_single_P018, viewed only; not stored in the repository).",
      "Single front view, so depth is assumed: torso upright with no twist; ankles ~0.44 m apart and ~3 cm behind the hip line, feet flat and turned out 10 deg each.",
      "Hands: wrists on the front-lateral waist just above the iliac crest (female wrist ~0.22 m off the midline, ~2 cm behind the pelvis centre), palms facing the body, fingers pointing forward-down; elbows ~8 cm behind the shoulders. The drawing's elbows flare further out in the frontal plane, but that needs upper-arm internal rotation beyond the 70 deg limit, so the elbows sit back and the upper-arm internal rotation is held at 69 deg.",
      "Shoulders raised slightly (clavicle elevation ~14 deg) to let the elbows flare; the upper-arm shells then sink ~44 mm (female) / ~47 mm (male) into the torso, within the 60 mm upperarm~torso allowance.",
      "Authored on rig/female.glb; the male uses the same rotations and the hips-height-relative root offset. On the male the palms end ~4-5 cm off the pelvis surface (narrower hips relative to arm span)."
    ],
    "generator": "scripts/pose_author/poses/pose_09_hands_on_hips.py"
  },
